{"id":"dadc9163c924a179","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-big-oh.md","title":"Asymptotic Notation","display":"df-big-oh — Asymptotic Notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-big-oh","aliases":["28-df-big-oh"],"display":"df-big-oh — Asymptotic Notation","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Definition 0.2","source_printed_pages":"3–4","source_pdf_pages":"29–30","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-big-oh"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-big-oh</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-big-oh — Asymptotic Notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Definition 0.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"3–4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"29–30"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb{N}\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\">\\(g:\\mathbb{N}\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\\)</span> (比较函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb{N}\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\">\\(f:\\mathbb{N}\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\\)</span> (候选函数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{O}(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb{N}\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\\mid\\exists c\\in\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(n\\geq n_0\\to f(n)\\leq c\\,g(n))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{O}(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb{N}\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\\mid\\exists c\\in\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(n\\geq n_0\\to f(n)\\leq c\\,g(n))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O(g)\\coloneqq\\mathcal O(g),\\qquad\\Omega(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:g\\in O(f)\\},\\qquad\\Theta(g)\\coloneqq O(g)\\cap\\Omega(g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O(g)\\coloneqq\\mathcal O(g),\\qquad\\Omega(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:g\\in O(f)\\},\\qquad\\Theta(g)\\coloneqq O(g)\\cap\\Omega(g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"o(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\ \\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n\\ge n_0\\Rightarrow f(n)\\le\\epsilon g(n))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[o(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\ \\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n\\ge n_0\\Rightarrow f(n)\\le\\epsilon g(n))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\omega(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:g\\in o(f)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\omega(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:g\\in o(f)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R5补齐 Definition 0.2 的五种记法并给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 与原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span> 同义接口；原有大O定义保留。旧时间层级节点曾引用本条尚未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o(g)\">\\(o(g)\\)</span>，现在该调用有实际形式来源。使用非负实值函数是原书自然数函数版本的直接推广；小o采用原书的非严格不等式，允许比较函数取零，不依赖除法极限的额外非零条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 0.2，印刷3–4 / PDF29–30；已核对五项原文及量词顺序。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"g:\\mathbb{N}\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb{N}\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{O}(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb{N}\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\\mid\\exists c\\in\\mathbb{R}_{>0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;(n\\geq n_0\\to f(n)\\leq c\\,g(n))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"O(g)\\coloneqq\\mathcal O(g),\\qquad\\Omega(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:g\\in O(f)\\},\\qquad\\Theta(g)\\coloneqq O(g)\\cap\\Omega(g).","display":true},{"tex":"o(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\ \\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n\\ge n_0\\Rightarrow f(n)\\le\\epsilon g(n))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega(g)\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:g\\in o(f)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"o(g)","display":false}],"bytes":1627,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"资源函数：[[28-df-big-oh]]、[[28-df-time-constructible]]、[[28-df-space-constructible]]、[[28-df-dtime]]、[[28-df-ntime]]、[[28-df-dspace]]、[[28-df-nspace]]。"},{"id":"acebbed2a6b79dac","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTIME}$ 采用本目录固定多带模型与常数因子约定；$o(g)$ 见 [[28-df-big-oh]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}